From 0000000000000000000000000000000000000000 Mon Sep 17 00:00:00 2001
From: jayweihung <3034830+jayweihung@users.noreply.github.com>
Date: Fri, 13 Nov 2026 14:56:40 +0800
Subject: [PATCH 2/6] fix: keep mod drags from moving windows, and from
 reaching the wrong mod

A drag started in a window overlay or a window_drag area never moves the
window, even on a first move past both thresholds. Drops queued for a copy that
closed meanwhile expire after two seconds, and a drag whose source names two
mods reaches neither. The drop plumbing moves to src/mods/drops.rs and
drag::record, and the shipped panels take it with their own import lines.

Co-Authored-By: Claude Opus 5.5 <noreply@anthropic.com>
